      {
        "id": "model-matrix-form",
        "moduleId": "closure-form-factor",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "补充：矩阵形式与求解方法",
        "markdown": "把 $n$ 个方程整理成线性系统：\n\n$$(1-\\rho_kF_{kk})B_k-\\rho_k\\sum_{j\\ne k}B_jF_{jk}=E_k,\\quad k=1,2,\\dots,n$$\n\n即 $\\mathbf{A}\\mathbf{B}=\\mathbf{E}$，对角元是 $1-\\rho_kF_{kk}$，非对角元是 $-\\rho_kF_{jk}$。矩阵通常稠密且规模随面片数增长，因此教材既给出高斯消解、LU 分解等直接法，也给出 Gauss-Seidel 迭代：用当前的 $B_j$ 反复代入右端更新每个 $B_k$，直到相邻两次结果近似相等。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-closure-and-equation"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-form-factor",
        "moduleId": "closure-form-factor",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "形状因子的定义与约束",
        "markdown": "形状因子是求解的前提，其几何定义为\n\n$$F_{jk}=\\dfrac{1}{A_j}\\int_{\\mathrm{surf}_j}\\int_{\\mathrm{surf}_k}\\dfrac{\\cos\\phi_j\\cos\\phi_k}{\\pi r^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}A_k\\,\\mathrm{d}A_j$$\n\n教材给出三条必须满足的性质：能量守恒 $\\sum_{k=1}^{n}F_{jk}=1$；互易性 $A_jF_{jk}=A_kF_{kj}$；仅含平面片和凸面片时 $F_{jj}=0$。实际计算把每个表面细分为许多小多边形，细分越细越真实，但绘制时间越长；常用**半立方体**近似半球以加速形状因子的计算。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000708"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
